=== P5: the two DIFFERENT routes to a zero contribution
  n=4 self-mirror reactions (map to themselves): ['dis:X1+X2->2B', 'dis:X3+X4->2B', 'rec:B+X3->2X3', 'rec:B+X4->2X4', 'rev-dis:2B->X1+X2', 'rev-dis:2B->X3+X4', 'rev-rec:2X3->B+X3', 'rev-rec:2X4->B+X4']
  n=4 p=q pairs (distinct mirrors, contributions cancel): ['rev-dis:2B->X1+X3', 'rev-dis:2B->X1+X4', 'rev-dis:2B->X2+X3', 'rev-dis:2B->X2+X4']
  -> two different mechanisms, both giving zero; §54 saw only the first.

